S(S_HELP,        900,
  "fleches ou h/j/k/l : choisir\n"
  "entree : ouvrir     b : retour\n"
  ", . : onglet precedent / suivant\n"
  "n/p : page suivante / precedente\n"
  "v : grille / liste compacte\n"
  "s : chercher (titre, auteur)\n"
  "c : configuration (serveur, dossier, mot de passe, langue)\n"
  "q : retour au BASIC\n\n"
  "Fiche : g telecharge sur le LOCI (verifie par CRC-32), l lance : cassette montee + CLOAD\"\" ou disquette + demarrage Microdisc.\n\n"
  "Reglages : PROPHET.CFG sur le LOCI. Marqueurs de telechargement : .prophet/ dans le dossier.\n\n"
  "ProphetOric " VERSION " - prophet.3617.fr",
  "arrows or h/j/k/l: choose\n"
  "enter: open     b: back\n"
  ", . : previous / next tab\n"
  "n/p: next / previous page\n"
  "v: card grid / compact list\n"
  "s: search (title, author)\n"
  "c: settings (server, folder, password, language)\n"
  "q: back to BASIC\n\n"
  "Sheet: g downloads to the LOCI (checked by CRC-32), l launches: tape mounted + CLOAD\"\" or disk + Microdisc boot.\n\n"
  "Settings: PROPHET.CFG on the LOCI. Download markers: .prophet/ in the folder.\n\n"
  "ProphetOric " VERSION " - prophet.3617.fr",
  "flechas o h/j/k/l: elegir\n"
  "intro: abrir     b: volver\n"
  ", . : pestana anterior / siguiente\n"
  "n/p: pagina siguiente / anterior\n"
  "v: cuadricula / lista compacta\n"
  "s: buscar (titulo, autor)\n"
  "c: configuracion (servidor, carpeta, clave, idioma)\n"
  "q: volver al BASIC\n\n"
  "Ficha: g descarga al LOCI (verificado por CRC-32), l lanza: cinta montada + CLOAD\"\" o disco + arranque Microdisc.\n\n"
  "Ajustes: PROPHET.CFG en el LOCI. Marcadores de descarga: .prophet/ en la carpeta.\n\n"
  "ProphetOric " VERSION " - prophet.3617.fr")
